1
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:33,000
Live forever or die trying.

2
00:10:54,000 --> 00:11:00,000
In Time is a action, thriller, science fiction film directed by Andrew Niccol.

3
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:27,000
In the not-too-distant future, the aging gene has been switched off.

4
00:21:48,000 --> 00:21:54,000
To avoid overpopulation, time has become the currency and the
way people pay for luxuries and necessities.

5
00:27:15,000 --> 00:27:21,000
The rich can live forever, while the rest struggle
to negotiate for their immortality.

6
00:32:42,000 --> 00:32:48,000
A poor young man who suddenly comes into a fortune of time finds himself on the
run from a corrupt police force known as the "time keepers".

7
00:38:09,000 --> 00:38:15,000
Will Salas, played by Justin Timberlake.

8
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:42,000
Sylvia Weis, played by Amanda Seyfried.

9
00:49:03,000 --> 00:49:09,000
Raymond Leon, played by Cillian Murphy.

10
00:54:30,000 --> 00:54:36,000
Rachel Salas, played by Olivia Wilde.

11
00:59:57,000 --> 01:00:03,000
Fortis, played by Alex Pettyfer.

12
01:05:24,000 --> 01:05:30,000
Borel, played by Johnny Galecki.

13
01:10:51,000 --> 01:10:57,000
In Time is a 2011 American science fiction action film
written, co-produced, and directed by Andrew Niccol.

14
01:16:18,000 --> 01:16:24,000
Justin Timberlake and Amanda Seyfried star as inhabitants of a society that uses time from one's lifespan as its primary
currency, with each individual possessing a clock on their arm that counts down how long they have to live.

15
01:21:45,000 --> 01:21:51,000
Cillian Murphy, Vincent Kartheiser, Olivia Wilde, Matt Bomer,
Johnny Galecki, and Alex Pettyfer also star.

16
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:18,000
The film was released on October 28, 2011, and grossed
$174 million against a $40 million budget.

17
01:32:39,000 --> 01:32:45,000
It received mixed reviews from critics, who praised the
premise while criticizing its execution.

18
01:38:06,000 --> 01:38:12,000
The film explores themes of future, race against
time, immortality, bank, dystopia.

19
01:43:33,000 --> 01:43:39,000
The tone is thought_provoking and intense.
